<Base title="OopBuy guides and updates — OopBuy Findsheet"><main class="wrap page"><h1 data-i18n="seo">SEO updates</h1><div class="article-grid"><article class="article"><h2 data-i18n="article1">How to use an OopBuy spreadsheet</h2><p data-i18n="article1_desc">Browse a category, compare the original listing and open the platform only after checking the item ID, options and current price.</p><p data-i18n="seo_article_body_1">Start with the category or search box and compare the listing image, title and product identifier. The catalog is a historical snapshot, so open the OopBuy product page to confirm the seller, current availability, price, size and colour before ordering. A spreadsheet helps organise research; it cannot confirm stock or product authenticity.</p></article><article class="article"><h2 data-i18n="article2">Review photos before ordering</h2><p data-i18n="article2_desc">Compare measurements, materials, details and variations. Product photos and warehouse QC photos serve different purposes.</p><p data-i18n="seo_article_body_2">Seller images show the advertised item, while warehouse QC photos, when available, show the item that arrived for inspection. Compare the visible colour, labels, measurements and stitching with the selected variant. If a detail is unclear or appears damaged, contact OopBuy before submitting the parcel; photos cannot guarantee fit, authenticity or durability.</p></article><article class="article"><h2 data-i18n="article3">Plan for shipping</h2><p data-i18n="article3_desc">Consider parcel weight, destination, shipping lines and possible import charges. Confirm the latest conditions on OopBuy.</p><p data-i18n="seo_article_body_3">Before paying for international delivery, review the destination, available shipping routes, packed dimensions and chargeable weight. Seller-to-warehouse delivery, optional packing, international shipping and import taxes can be separate charges. Compare the final quotation and destination restrictions on OopBuy, and keep the tracking number after dispatch.</p></article></div></main></Base>
